  "description": "Haedam was always special among humans for being unafraid of the hybrids who are vaulted as higher-class citizens. Perhaps it was her desperation to make money for her sick sister that allowed her to work for Sahyuk the snake hybrid for so many years. Regardless of the reason, Sahyuk has only become more fascinated with his servant and his feelings have only grown more carnal. \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Gyeryak Danpyeonseon (계략 단편선) Collection.*",
